# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms). Nothing here is required.
#
# Vercel only hosts the site and does not send email, so the contact form posts
# to Web3Forms, which forwards each message to the inbox the key was made for.
# Get a free key at https://web3forms.com using Joshua's inbox.
#
# Either paste the key into src/constants/site.ts (CONTACT.web3formsKey), or set
# this variable in Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables and
# redeploy. For local testing, copy this file to .env.local (ignored by git).
# While no key is set, the form opens the visitor's email app instead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
